00:08:38.262 --> 00:08:41.999
>> FROM HIS EARLY YEARS AT THE SAN FRANCISCO REDEVELOPMENT

00:08:41.999 --> 00:08:46.137
AGENCY WHERE HE LED CRITICAL REVITALIZATION EFFORTS AND BABY

00:08:46.137 --> 00:08:50.346
HUNTERS POINT TO HIS TRANSFORMATIVE WORK AT THE PORT

00:08:50.346 --> 00:08:54.170
OF SAN FRANCISCO. BYRON BROUGHT VISION COMPARE

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:55.284
VISION AND PURPOSE TO EVERYTHING HE TOUCHED.

00:08:55.284 --> 00:08:58.954
AS PLANNING AND DEVELOPMENT DIRECTOR AND LATER AS CHIEF

00:08:58.954 --> 00:09:03.826
