00:21:03.927 --> 00:21:07.932
SAN FRANCISCO'S ZONING LAWS TRY TO TELL PEOPLE WHO COUNTS AS A

00:21:07.932 --> 00:21:08.866
FAMILY. IF WE WANT TO BE A MORE

00:21:08.866 --> 00:21:11.802
AFFORDABLE CITY WE HAVE TO START BY LEGALIZING THE WAY

00:21:11.802 --> 00:21:15.940
REAL SAN FRANCISCANS LIVE. >> UNDER CURRENT LAW,

00:21:15.940 --> 00:21:19.143
HOUSEHOLDS OF MORE THAN FIVE UNRELATED TO INDIVIDUALS WHO DO

00:21:19.143 --> 00:21:22.880
NOT COOK MEALS TOGETHER MUST MEET GROUP HOUSING STANDARDS

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:26.283
OFTEN MAKING OLDER HOMES WITH HOUSEMATES TECHNICALLY

00:21:26.283 --> 00:21:29.883
NON-COMPLIANT. SO TODAY I'M INTRODUCING THE

00:21:30.488 --> 00:21:33.958
SHARED HOUSING REFORM ACT WHICH REMEDIES THIS IN SEVERAL WAYS.

00:21:33.958 --> 00:21:38.950
ONE IT REPLACES THE TERM FAMILY WITH HOUSEHOLD THROUGHOUT THE

00:21:38.950 --> 00:21:42.295
PLANNING CODE. TWO IT REMOVES NUMERIC LIMITS

00:21:42.432 --> 00:21:45.432
ON UNRELATED RESIDENTS LIVING TOGETHER.

00:21:45.902 --> 00:21:49.973
>> THREE IT ESTABLISHES A NINE LEASE THRESHOLD TO DISTINGUISH

00:21:49.973 --> 00:21:53.244
SHARED HOUSEHOLDS FROM INSTITUTIONAL GROUP HOUSING.

00:21:53.244 --> 00:21:57.444
>> FOUR IT RECOGNIZES SHARED FINANCIAL RESPONSIBLE BILITY

00:21:57.981 --> 00:22:01.185
LIKE RENT AND UTILITIES AS THE DEFINING FEATURE OF A HOUSEHOLD

00:22:01.185 --> 00:22:02.319
. AND LASTLY IT ALIGNS LOCAL LAW

00:22:02.319 --> 00:22:06.390
WITH STATE MANDATES TO TREAT COMMUNITY CARE AND RECOVERY

00:22:06.390 --> 00:22:11.790
FACILITIES SERVING SIX OR FEWER INDIVIDUALS AS DWELLING UNITS.

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:14.265
THE PLANNING CODE WAS AMENDED TO LIMIT THE NUMBER OF

00:22:14.265 --> 00:22:17.735
UNRELATED ROOMMATES THAT COULD LIVE TOGETHER AROUND THE TIME

00:22:17.735 --> 00:22:20.871
